00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.209
Well, not like this.
Rachel, whenever you're ready,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.410
step up to the mic.
-Over here? Okay.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.412
-And the music will begin.
Rachel Dratch.

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:48.948
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.149
Band, whenever you're ready.

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.817
